    "identifier": "mastery-of-self",
    "description": "<p>Beginning at 20th level, your intense training has brought on a mastery of self that cannot be emulated or replicated.</p>\n<p>You can use each ability granted in your Chakra Valves class feature at no Martial Die cost.</p>\n<p>You gain immunity to the Envenomed, Exhaustion and Dazed conditions.</p>\n<p>When you make a Constitution save to take only half damage, you instead take no damage and suffer no effects on a success and only half damage if you fail.</p>\n<p>You gain a Rank of Mastery in Constitution and Wisdom saving throws.</p>",
